  "description": "One day, I suddenly became the protagonist of a game. However, the more you look at this protagonist... the more you'll sigh. He's got the worst stats, the worst talent and zero connections. But still… You have acquired \\[Heavenly Martial Physique\\]. You have become the master of the \\[Martial God's Tome\\].\n\n*“So what? I’m the ultimate veteran player!”*\n\nHe's not just a veteran player— he’s a full-blown obsessive maniac. Thus begins the legendary playthrough of a hardcore veteran!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
